h graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and native SwiftUI. One helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example.","type":"text"}]},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/keyframeAnimator(initialValue:repeating:content:keyframes:)":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView\/keyframeAnimator(initialValue:repeating:content:keyframes:)","type":"topic","title":"keyframeAnimator(initialValue:repeating:content:keyframes:)","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"keyframeAnimator","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Value","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"initialValue","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Value","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"repeating","kind":"externalParam"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Bool","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"content"},{"kind":"text","text":": ("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"PlaceholderContentView","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI22PlaceholderContentViewV"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":">, "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Value"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"some"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"View","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4ViewP"},{"kind